1. Install Firefox
2. Go to https://addons.mozilla.org/extensions/ and install adblock. 
3. Restart Firefox.
4. Go to Dudley's dungeon http://www.nicolaas.net/dudley/ and right click 
on the Google adverts. Select 'Adblock iframe' from the bottom of the popup 
menu. In the edit box, reduce the URL to an obviously non-variable part 
e.g. pagead2.googlesyndication.com
5. reload the page. No more Google syndication adverts anywhere.
6. Repeat from 4 for all the websites that really do have annoying adverts.


